# src/packages/control-ui/src/locales/seed

## Purpose
Preserves seed/reference localization resources used to bootstrap or compare Control UI translations.

## Contents
Contains locale seed files retained for compatibility, generation, or translation reference rather than independent application logic.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Used by localization tooling or maintainers and relates to the canonical frontend locale contracts in the parent localization package.

## Invariants
Seed keys and placeholders stay compatible with canonical locale schemas, files remain deterministic UTF-8 text, and seed material must not become an unreviewed second runtime localization authority.